        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jefferson Davis, Daniel S. Lamont\n- Roles: President of the Confederate States, United States Secretary of War\n- Places: White House of the Confederacy, Beauvoir\n- Topics: Confederate leadership succession\n\nFacts:\n- Jefferson Davis was the sole President associated with the White House of the Confederacy.\n- Jefferson Davis lived at Beauvoir after his presidency.\n- The United States office discussed in the chunk is the United States Secretary of War.\n- Daniel S. Lamont held the office of United States Secretary of War.\n- The person who held the office of United States Secretary of War under Beauvoir was elected President under the Provisional Confederate States Constitution.",
